  "definitions_zh_TW": [
    {
      "text": "姓。通「倪」。",
      "lang": "zh-Hant-TW",
      "register": "dictionary",
      "source_id": "moe-tw-concised-dictionary-2014-20260626",
      "source_entry_id": "1636",
      "verbatim": true
    },
    {
      "text": "1.小孩。[例]兒童、嬰兒\r\n2.父母稱呼子女或子女對父母的自稱。[例]我兒、小兒\r\n3.長輩稱呼晚輩。[例]姪兒、孫兒\r\n4.年輕的人。多指男性。[例]健兒",
      "lang": "zh-Hant-TW",
      "register": "dictionary",
      "source_id": "moe-tw-concised-dictionary-2014-20260626",
      "source_entry_id": "5828",
      "verbatim": true
    },
    {
      "text": "詞綴。附於名詞、代名詞、形容詞、副詞等之後，與所附的詞合為兒化音，大多無意義。[例]花兒、這兒、快快兒",
      "lang": "zh-Hant-TW",
      "register": "dictionary",
      "source_id": "moe-tw-concised-dictionary-2014-20260626",
      "source_entry_id": "58261",
      "verbatim": true
    }
  ]
